      "body": "Approach NACK and appears to be AI written, please read the AI policy.\r\n\r\nAn issue would be more appropriate for this problem rather than a PR.\r\n\r\nThere are definitely ways to do migration better, and #34193 should resolve many issues in a more comprehensive manner. There are further ideas to increase robustness of migration which will take some time to implement, but can probably handle all such failure scenarios better.\r\n\r\nAlso, whatever your CIFS configuration is not one that we can support. We rely heavily on sqlite which has its own requirements on filesystems. If sqlite cannot work on your filesystems, then we will not be able to load the wallet, even after migration.",
